        "original_id": "c570d3cf-bd39-5a34-9291-3c1a06be532e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Beach, David Ayer, Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman, Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Ike Barinholtz, Scott Eastwood, Cara Delevingne\n- Works: Arctic Air, Suicide Squad, Cold, Law & Order: Special Victims Unit\n- Characters/Roles: Slipknot, Detective Chester Lake, Special Victims Unit squad\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Beach starred in the Canadian television series Arctic Air from 2012 to 2014.\n- In the Law & Order: Special Victims Unit episode Cold, Adam Beach played Detective Chester Lake.\n- In Cold, Detective Chester Lake refuses to cooperate after fatally shooting a police officer, which leads the Special Victims Unit squad to investigate what he is hiding.\n- The 2016 film Suicide Squad was written and directed by David Ayer.\n- Adam Beach played Slipknot in the 2016 film Suicide Squad.\n- Suicide Squad features an ensemble cast including Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman, Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Ike Barinholtz, Scott Eastwood, and Cara Delevingne.",
